{
    "title": "Azar: Video Chat & Meet People",
    "description": "Azar is a 1:1 video chat app that instantly connects you with millions of people nearby and around the world. On Azar, you never know who you might meet - whether it\u2019s a fun chat with a stranger or finding someone you vibe with! Connection is just one chat away.\r\n\r\nWITH AZAR, YOU CAN:\r\n- Filter to your desires. Connect with any gender and region you want. You might meet friends globally!\r\n- Avoid randomness. Connecting with a perfect match based on your activities. Each chat is an opportunity for a new connection.\r\n- Talk and connect live. Have real conversations through 1:1 video chat. You never know who you\u2019ll meet next on Azar - maybe even a stranger who becomes a friend!\r\n\r\nEXPRESS YOURSELF THROUGH PERSONALIZED SETTINGS!\r\n- Be creative with your favorite special backgrounds and filters.\r\n- Our variety of beauty effects saves you preparation time so you can talk and video chat with new people comfortably anytime.\r\n\r\nREAL-TIME CONVERSATIONS!\r\nTired of doom scrolling? Want to engage and talk to new people for real? Don't wait for a response. With Azar, instantly meet new people online from all over the world through live video chats and start your conversations immediately. Azar's seamless connections ensure you can chat and meet new people anytime, anywhere.\r\n\r\nFREE and easy to use! Azar is free to download and simple to use. Whether you're in the mood to make new friends, talk to someone new, or simply have a fun video chat, Azar makes it easy and enjoyable for everyone!\r\n\r\nWant to learn more? Need help with your Azar account?\r\nGo to http://azarlive.com\r\nFind us on Facebook: http://www.facebook.com/azar.application\r\nFollow us on Instagram: https://instagram.com/azar_official\r\nMessage us: https://help.azarlive.com/hc\r\n\r\nAzar requires access to the following in order to provide the listed service.\r\n- Camera (Optional): Video Chat with new friends, add or save profile picture/video(s)\r\n- Microphone (Optional): Talk live via video chat with new friends, audio delivery\r\n- Storage (Optional): Upload picture/video(s) to profile\r\n\r\nThe experience and well-being of our users is our highest priority. Our support team and moderation services are backed by best-in-class AI software that reviews activity on our platform 24/7 to ensure a fun and positive experience.\r\n\r\nAzar provides a variety of in-app purchases and subscription options that give you more control over who you can meet. If you purchase an Azar subscription, your Play Store account will be charged, and your subscription will auto-renew within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period unless auto-renewal is turned off. Auto-renewal may be turned off at any time after your purchase has been completed by going to your settings in the Play Store.\r\n\r\nAll photos are of models and used for illustrative purposes only.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://azarlive.com/home/privacy-policy.html\r\nTerms of Use: https://azarlive.com/home/terms-of-service.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Azar is a 1:1 video chat app that instantly connects you with millions of people nearby and around the world. On Azar, you never know who you might meet - whether it\u2019s a fun chat with a stranger or finding someone you vibe with! Connection is just one chat away.<br><br>WITH AZAR, YOU CAN:<br>- Filter to your desires. Connect with any gender and region you want. You might meet friends globally!<br>- Avoid randomness. Connecting with a perfect match based on your activities. Each chat is an opportunity for a new connection.<br>- Talk and connect live. Have real conversations through 1:1 video chat. You never know who you\u2019ll meet next on Azar - maybe even a stranger who becomes a friend!<br><br>EXPRESS YOURSELF THROUGH PERSONALIZED SETTINGS!<br>- Be creative with your favorite special backgrounds and filters.<br>- Our variety of beauty effects saves you preparation time so you can talk and video chat with new people comfortably anytime.<br><br>REAL-TIME CONVERSATIONS!<br>Tired of doom scrolling? Want to engage and talk to new people for real? Don&#39;t wait for a response. With Azar, instantly meet new people online from all over the world through live video chats and start your conversations immediately. Azar&#39;s seamless connections ensure you can chat and meet new people anytime, anywhere.<br><br>FREE and easy to use! Azar is free to download and simple to use. Whether you&#39;re in the mood to make new friends, talk to someone new, or simply have a fun video chat, Azar makes it easy and enjoyable for everyone!<br><br>Want to learn more? Need help with your Azar account?<br>Go to http://azarlive.com<br>Find us on Facebook: http://www.facebook.com/azar.application<br>Follow us on Instagram: https://instagram.com/azar_official<br>Message us: https://help.azarlive.com/hc<br><br>Azar requires access to the following in order to provide the listed service.<br>- Camera (Optional): Video Chat with new friends, add or save profile picture/video(s)<br>- Microphone (Optional): Talk live via video chat with new friends, audio delivery<br>- Storage (Optional): Upload picture/video(s) to profile<br><br>The experience and well-being of our users is our highest priority. Our support team and moderation services are backed by best-in-class AI software that reviews activity on our platform 24/7 to ensure a fun and positive experience.<br><br>Azar provides a variety of in-app purchases and subscription options that give you more control over who you can meet. If you purchase an Azar subscription, your Play Store account will be charged, and your subscription will auto-renew within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period unless auto-renewal is turned off. Auto-renewal may be turned off at any time after your purchase has been completed by going to your settings in the Play Store.<br><br>All photos are of models and used for illustrative purposes only.<br><br>---<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://azarlive.com/home/privacy-policy.html<br>Terms of Use: https://azarlive.com/home/terms-of-service.html",
